# 基本図形編集をプロセスで (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: a figure of 30 small
# rectangles (8 square, 12 apart along the top) and two zigzag lines, made as a copy of
# 画用紙 (mkbig), opened with the figure editor running as a process (pfig) whatever the
# program object says. Its window stands where 画用紙 says (100,100 to 900,700), the work
# area from 110,127. A rectangle is taken and carried, a band pulled out, the tray copied
# to and pasted from, everything cut and moved back, the menu opened and put away, the
# figure saved, closed and opened again and found the same.
# Keys with Ctrl (01): A 04, C 06, V 19, X 1B, Z 1D, S 16, E 08; Delete 4C, Esc 29.
mkbig fig 30 4
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32
wait 800
shot pfig_open
# the first rectangle taken by its upper left (its right edge and foot size it), and
# carried 100 across and 200 down
logmark
click 111 128
expectsince figure: picked 1
logmark
drag 111 128 211 328
expectsince figure: moved 1 by 100,200
wait 300
shot pfig_moved
# a band from the empty page over the rectangles on the right
logmark
drag 700 330 300 129
expectsince figure: picked
wait 300
shot pfig_band
# the one carried taken again, copied to the tray and pasted: a shape more
logmark
click 212 329
expectsince figure: picked 1
logmark
key 06 01
expectsince figure: copied to the tray 1
logmark
key 19 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 33 shapes 1 picked
wait 300
shot pfig_pasted
# the pasted one deleted
logmark
key 4C
expectsince figure: deleted, 32 shapes
# everything cut, and moved back from the tray
logmark
key 04 01
expectsince figure: command selectall
logmark
key 1B 01
expectsince figure: deleted, 0 shapes
logmark
key 1D 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 32 shapes 32 picked
wait 300
shot pfig_back
# the menu, put away with Escape
logmark
click 600 500 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 500
shot pfig_menu
key 29
wait 300
# saved, closed, opened again: the same record
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum
keep saved
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince figure: closed
wait 500
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32
sum
same saved
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
absent !OACV!
